From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lei Wang <wangzl@amazon.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:14:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Log unconfigured runtimes and missing libc builds at
 debug level

The injector runs in every process of a container, and most containers
only use one runtime. Not having an agent path configured for a runtime,
and an agent prefix that has no build for the detected libc flavour
(e.g. a musl application with a glibc-only agent), are normal and now
log at debug level instead of info/error. A configured path that does
not exist is still logged as an error.
